-smoke. They do not prove real Cubin loading, numerical correctness, CUDA Graph,
-framework integration, Qwen coverage or performance.
+behavior plus the value-only observation seam separately from the required
+exclusive RTX 5090 non-default-stream smoke. They do not prove real Cubin
+loading, numerical correctness, CUDA Graph, framework integration, Qwen
+coverage or performance.
